{"verse_key": "10:36", "surah": 10, "verse": 36, "text_uthmani": "وَمَا يَتَّبِعُ أَكْثَرُهُمْ إِلَّا ظَنًّا ۚ إِنَّ ٱلظَّنَّ لَا يُغْنِى مِنَ ٱلْحَقِّ شَيْـًٔا ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلِيمٌۢ بِمَا يَفْعَلُونَ", "translation": "And most of them follow not except assumption. Indeed, assumption avails not against the truth at all. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing of what they do.", "verse_from_ms": 919330, "verse_to_ms": 938480, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 919330, "end_ms": 920310}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَتَّبِعُ", "start_ms": 920310, "end_ms": 921280}, {"i": 2, "text": "أَكْثَرُهُمْ", "start_ms": 921280, "end_ms": 922480}, {"i": 3, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 922480, "end_ms": 923160}, {"i": 4, "text": "ظَنًّا", "start_ms": 923160, "end_ms": 925250}, {"i": 5, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 925250, "end_ms": 926100}, {"i": 6, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 926100, "end_ms": 927400}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلظَّنَّ", "start_ms": 927400, "end_ms": 927810}, {"i": 8, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 927810, "end_ms": 928610}, {"i": 9, "text": "يُغْنِى", "start_ms": 928610, "end_ms": 928930}, {"i": 10, "text": "مِنَ", "start_ms": 928930, "end_ms": 929760}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلْحَقِّ", "start_ms": 929760, "end_ms": 931310}, {"i": 12, "text": "شَيْـًٔا", "start_ms": 931310, "end_ms": 932440}, {"i": 13, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 932440, "end_ms": 933270}, {"i": 14, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 933270, "end_ms": 934730}, {"i": 15, "text": "ٱللَّهَ", "start_ms": 934730, "end_ms": 935350}, {"i": 16, "text": "عَلِيمٌۢ", "start_ms": 935350, "end_ms": 938015}, {"i": 17, "text": "بِمَا", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 18, "text": "يَفْعَلُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}